    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p><strong>Frequency</strong> Once per day</p><p><strong>Trigger </strong>A creature within 30 feet critically succeeds or critically fails on a roll.</p><p><strong>Requirements</strong> You are currently actively pursuing your edicts or goals and you have not used Echo of Balance today.</p><hr><p><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">You react to unfavorable events by taking advantage of the pulse of fate, tilting the cosmic order to aid you. If the creature has a critical success, it becomes a success; if the creature has a critical failure, it becomes a failure. This action gains the Misfortune or the Fortune trait respectively, and uses your daily use of Echo of Balance.</span></p>"
